msgstr "Utiliser des sections d'introduction périphériques"

#: temp.glade:37191
msgid "Check this option if the INT book contains \n"
"peripheral divisions (sub-sections) which \n"
"need to be inserted at the appropriate position\n"
"between books. For example:\n"
"  \\periph Old Testament Introduction|id=\"intot\"\n"
"  \\periph New Testament Introduction|id=\"intnt\"\n"
"  \\periph Gospels Introduction|id=\"intgospels\""
msgstr "Cochez cette option si le livre INT contient des \n"
"divisions périphériques (sous-sections) qui \n"
"doivent être insérées à la position appropriée\n"
"entre les livres. Par exemple :\n"
"  \\périphérique Introduction à l'Ancien Testament|id= \"intot\"\n"
"  \\périphérique Introduction au Nouveau Testament|id= \"intnt\"\n"
"  \\périphérique Introduction aux Évangiles|id= \"intgospels\""

#: temp.glade:37221
msgid "Local Front Matter"
msgstr "Pages liminaires locales"

#: temp.glade:37222
msgid "Enable (local) front matter"
msgstr "Activation des pages de garde (locale)"

#: temp.glade:37227
msgid "PTXprint does not directly typeset the FRT\n"
"book from Paratext. Instead, it uses a \"local\"\n"
"PTXprint-specific copy of Paratext's FRT book \n"
"which can be enhanced by additional codes\n"
"which are described on the View+Edit tab's\n"
"Information button.\n\n"
"Note: turning this on turns the Colophon off\n"
"(you can turn it on again). A cover needs\n"
"Local Front Matter."
msgstr ""

#: temp.glade:37253
msgid "View (or edit) front matter"
msgstr "Visualiser (ou éditer) les pages de garde"

#: temp.glade:37269
msgid "Force Page Break \n"
"at each Periph"
msgstr "Forcer un saut de page \n"
"à chaque Periph"

#: temp.glade:37271
msgid "Front matter: Force page break at each periph section"
msgstr "Pages de garde : Forcer le saut de page à chaque section périphérique"

#: temp.glade:37275
msgid "This option is normally checked so that each\n"
"different section of the front matter will begin\n"
"on a new page."
msgstr "Cette option est normalement cochée afin que chaque\n"
"section différente des pages liminaires commence\n"
"sur une nouvelle page."

#: temp.glade:37293
msgid "Suppress Blank Page\n"
"Before Scripture Text"
msgstr "Supprimer la page vide\n"
"avant le texte biblique"

#: temp.glade:37295
msgid "Front matter: Suppress blank page at start of scripture text"
msgstr "Page de garde : Suppression de la page blanche au début du texte de l'Écriture"

#: temp.glade:37299
msgid "By default, the main body of scripture always starts\n"
"on an odd (right-hand-side) page. PTXprint will\n"
"automatically insert a pagebreak if needed to make\n"
"this happen. If you wish to override this behavior,\n"
"then check this option (to NOT insert a blank page\n"
"after any front matter material)."
msgstr "Par défaut, le corps principal de l'écriture commence toujours\n"
"sur une page impaire (côté droit). Si nécessaire, PTXprint insérera\n"
"automatiquement un saut de page pour assurer cela. Pour ne pas \n"
"insérer la page vide automatiquement, cochez cette option (pour\n"
"EMPÊCHER l’insertion d’une page vide après les pages liminaires)."

#: temp.glade:37333
msgid "Include Maps"
msgstr "Inclure les cartes"

#: temp.glade:37338
msgid "Add the map book (usually XXM) to the list\n"
"of books to print. Use Add Maps... to create\n"
"the map pages."
msgstr ""

#: temp.glade:37424
msgid "Enter your Colophon text here - using standard\n"
"USFM codes for formatting. You may want to\n"
"use the reset button to start with a standard set.\n\n"
"You can use the following codes to\n"
"automatically include special text \n"
"using the following markers:\n"
"\\zcopyright   - copyright statement from the Basic tab\n"
"\\zlicense     - License text from the Basic tab\n"
"\\zimagecopyrights   - Automatically generated list of images, page numbers and attributions.\n"
"\\zimagecopyrightsfr - as above, but use localized (fr = French) version (es, fr, hu, id, pt, ro available).\n\n"
"\\b can be used to insert a blank line between markers if needed.\n\n"
"If using a Left-to-Right script for the colophon in a RTL publication\n"
"you will need to add \\beginL to force the colophon to render LTR.\n"
"For example:\n"
"   \\pc \\beginL \\zcopyright\n"
"   \\pc \\beginL \\zlicense\n"
"   \\pc \\beginL \\zimagecopyrights\n\n"
"These special codes may also be used in other\n"
"books such as the front matter book (FRT). \n\n"
"IMPORTANT: You will have to click Print a second time\n"
"in order to get accurate Image Copyright Attribution."
msgstr ""

#: temp.glade:37453
msgid "Colophon Text:"
msgstr "Texte du colophon :"

#: temp.glade:37480
msgid "Colophon text entry"
msgstr "Entrée du texte du colophon"

#: temp.glade:37483
msgid "Note: There are several shortcuts you can use:\n"
"   (c) --> ©  the copyright sign\n"
"   (r) --> ®  to denote registered trademarks\n"
"   (tm) --> ™  to denote trademarks in general\n\n"
"Other special codes converted at print time:\n"
"use ~ for places where a non-breaking space is needed\n"
"use // where a line break needs to be forced\n"
"but :// used in URLs will still be preserved"
msgstr "Note : Il existe plusieurs raccourcis que vous pouvez utiliser :\n"
"   (c) --> © le signe copyright\n"
"   (r) --> ® pour désigner les marques déposées\n"
"   (tm) --> ™ pour désigner les marques en général\n\n"
"Autres codes spéciaux convertis au moment de l'impression :\n"
"utiliser ~ pour les endroits où un espace sans rupture est nécessaire\n"
"utiliser // où un retour à la ligne doit être forcé\n"
"mais :// utilisé dans les URL sera toujours conservé"

#: temp.glade:37512
msgid "Clicking this button will reload the \n"
"default Colophon text markers which\n"
"include the Copyright statement tag,\n"
"the License statement tag, and the\n"
"Illustration credits tag. Your current\n"
"colophon text will be replaced."
msgstr ""

#: temp.glade:37536
msgid "Force Page Break \n"
"Before Colophon"
msgstr "Forcer le saut de page \n"
"avant colophon"

#: temp.glade:37538
msgid "Force page break before colophon"
msgstr "Forcer le saut de page avant le colophon"

#: temp.glade:37543
msgid "Normally the colophon is inserted at the end\n"
"of the last page of the last book. If this option\n"
"is checked, then the colophon will appear at the \n"
"bottom of a new page at the end of the publication.\n\n"
"In Diglot publications, the colophon always appears\n"
"on its own page - regardless of this setting. "
msgstr "Normalement, le colophon est inséré à la fin\n"
"de la dernière page du dernier livre. Si cette option\n"
"est cochée, le colophon apparaîtra au bas d'une\n"
"nouvelle page à la fin de la publication.\n\n"
"Dans les publications Diglot, le colophon apparaît toujours\n"
"sur sa propre page - indépendamment de ce paramètre. "

#: temp.glade:37564
msgid "Colophon at End of Publication"
msgstr "Colophon à la fin de la publication"

#: temp.glade:37565
msgid "Enable colophon at end of publication"
msgstr "Activer le colophon à la fin de la publication"

#: temp.glade:37569
msgid "What is a Colophon?\n"
"A brief statement containing information\n"
"about the publication such as the place of \n"
"publication, the publisher, and the date of \n"
"publication. This will be printed at the END\n"
"of the book. Similar to a \"biblio-page\" or a\n"
"\"copyright-page\" at the front of a book.\n\n"
"NOTE: The picture credits (\\zimagecopyrights)\n"
"are only correct after you click Print a\n"
"second time."
msgstr ""

#: temp.glade:37608
